{"createdAt":1785081543552,"expiresAt":1785167943552,"key":"https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=4047130&filters=basic%2Cprice_overview%2Crelease_date%2Cplatforms%2Cdemos%2Cgenres&cc=MY&l=english","data":{"4047130":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Cardwheel","steam_appid":4047130,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin. Drop. Score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardwheel is a fun roguelite where you drop balls into a big spin wheel. Each run begins with choosing a wheel, and each wheel changes the difficulty and how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047130/extras/ca5855f0c849e80a3b345c3cd6af82f9.poster.avif?t=1772550587\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047130/extras/ca5855f0c849e80a3b345c3cd6af82f9.webm?t=1772550587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047130/extras/ca5855f0c849e80a3b345c3cd6af82f9.mp4?t=1772550587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎡 Choose Your Wheel: Each wheel gives you a unique setup and starting resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🃏 Make Your Choice: Enter the next round, or skip it for powerful bonuses like cash, free card packs, or guaranteed rare jokers in the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047130/extras/5dc95589cbe7439063626c458f849536.poster.avif?t=1772550587\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047130/extras/5dc95589cbe7439063626c458f849536.webm?t=1772550587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047130/extras/5dc95589cbe7439063626c458f849536.mp4?t=1772550587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Spin for Score: Drop 6 balls into a wheel of 4 colors. Match colors to rack up chips, multiply your total, and try to clear the round’s score goal. However, be cautious, as your spins are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 Shop &amp; Upgrade: Between rounds, visit the shop to buy jokers and card packs. Jokers twist the rules (e.g., more chips for red balls, multipliers for pairs), while card packs change how balls, slots, or colors behave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047130/extras/f46cc6862250848ae1d8f86c71e70e4a.poster.avif?t=1772550587\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047130/extras/f46cc6862250848ae1d8f86c71e70e4a.webm?t=1772550587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047130/extras/f46cc6862250848ae1d8f86c71e70e4a.mp4?t=1772550587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👹 Boss Challenges: Every three rounds, face a unique twist. Some colors stop scoring, modifiers shut down, or jokers get disabled. Adapt fast; there are 8 bosses to beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"h